    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but isn't it basically the same thing regardless of the excuse? if a state is the one deciding what \"extreme emergency\" means, they can just manufacture a crisis to justify cutting people off. doesn't that mean the whole idea of \"security-based regulation\" is just a loophole for authoritarianism?",
